ng requirements.\n\nRefs #38\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":127,"deletions":0},"docs":{"insertions":20,"deletions":0},"test-code":{"insertions":117,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"82a3ee938a42ec3c33807ae260d625fcbe717f27","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add parsing support for marking orders complete","messageBody":"Order completion currently has no recognized command.\nParse mark-order-complete requests with validated client and order\nindices before integrating completion changes with the model.\n\nReject malformed, repeated, and overflowing arguments with useful\nerrors. Report deferred execution without changing existing data.\nAdd parser and command tests and document the parsing requirements.\n\nRefs #39\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":127,"deletions":0},"docs":{"insertions":20,"deletions":0},"test-code":{"insertions":117,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"c18a7cab16b1d44c0b294ee80a4dd4b091bfb821","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add parsing support for unmarking client orders","messageBody":"Reversing order completion currently has no recognized command.\nParse unmark requests with validated client and order indices before\nintegrating restoration of incomplete status with the model.\n\nReject malformed, repeated, and overflowing arguments with useful\nerrors. Report deferred execution without changing existing data.\nAdd parser and command tests and document the parsing requirements.\n\nRefs #40\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":127,"deletions":0},"docs":{"insertions":20,"deletions":0},"test-code":{"insertions":117,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"f0ea26bd60c0358f02d6deecbc2d0edc8da2d7de","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge bakery item parsing foundation","messageBody":"Use the bakery item value objects and parser from team PR #34 as the dependency for persistent client orders. Preserve both item and order parsing during integration.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"018f97a50b1eaf4b47cf34893d1b234550f40aae","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Persist client orders and their associations","messageBody":"Parsed orders cannot yet be added, reopened, or consumed by the other\norder commands. Bakery items also need a stored collection for orders\nto reference real products.\n\nAdd immutable orders with independent UUIDs and observable model APIs.\nResolve displayed indices at execution, preserve client associations\non edits, and block deletion of referenced clients and items.\n\nStore items and orders in editable JSON while supporting legacy AB3\nfiles. Replace saved files safely and restore data and filters when\nsaving fails. Connect the existing add-item command to this foundation.\n\nAdd backend and persistence tests and align both guides with behavior.\nBuild on the team\u0027s bakery parser in PR #34.\n\nRefs #35\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":632,"deletions":38},"docs":{"insertions":50,"deletions":30},"test-code":{"insertions":313,"deletions":3}}},{"hash":"9f4d38e67a0dace63aab6c4a10d01b82b5e1e3ad","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Delete client orders and persist changes","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"89331b5aa5e0bdc9b7d5a1eb777fc5a8bda533d4","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Mark client orders complete and persist status","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"22a10b8490c374b62e0c6ecd566a11ba3a0ea2c3","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Restore client orders to incomplete status","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"d5d3da1201bca1ca388e88787b373885fc0b2f41","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #34 from Yik-Wee/add-bakery-item-parser","messageBody":"Add parsing support for add-item command","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"0f1dbc2cf109fcec5410b4299310f3e06cb4b88c","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into delete-client-orders","mess